Author: agent <agent@local>
Date:   Fri Nov 13 10:58:46 2026 +0000

    m17986: MF-LBM-style job-status/wall-clock checkpoint machine (XVAL + LBMSimulation integration)
    
    - src/tensorlbm/job_checkpoint.py: job_status.txt state machine
      (new/continue/done/failed/reached_max_step), hour-based checkpoint policy,
      primary+second backup via atomic_torch_save, sha256 payload digest,
      config-signature guard, VolumeTrigger (d_vol analogue), resume state.
    - src/tensorlbm/simulation.py: LBMSimulation.enable_checkpointing /
      run_with_checkpointing; step() drives the machine and writes the terminal state.
    - tests: 20 invariant tests (bit-exact restart, backup rescue, terminal states,
      zero recompute, trigger semantics) + artifact re-check of the delivered bundle.
    - benchmarks/xval_job_checkpoint: XVAL against lanl/MF-LBM
      (oss_solutions NEW:wall-clock-checkpoint-state-machine), ref-vs-got table,
      sensitivity study, figures, repro.sh; docs/xval report (six sections).

